      <VERS vnumber="1"> O <gr str="1980">come</gr>, let us <gr str="7442">sing </gr>unto the <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>: let us make a joyful <gr str="7321">noise </gr>to the <gr str="6697">rock </gr>of our <gr str="3468">salvation</gr>. </VERS>
